lumen01/agent-bark-notify  0.1.6 -> 0.1.7
change_type: code   changelog: - Initial release with foundational skill files and directory structure. - Added examples, scripts, agent asset, tests, and workflow files for configuration and CI. - Removed outdated documentation file (skill-card.md). - No changes to user/agent usage or notification logic.

### .clawhubignore  [code]
+ # Created inside the skill root by ClawHub's reusable GitHub Actions workflow.
+ clawhub-source/
+ # ClawHub stores extensionless files as binary even when their contents are text.
+ LICENSE

### .github/workflows/clawhub-publish.yml  [code]
+ name: Publish Bark Notify to ClawHub
+ on:
+   push:
+     branches: [main]
+     paths:
+       - SKILL.md
+       - scripts/**
+       - assets/**
+       - examples/**
+       - agents/**
+       - README.md
+       - README.zh-CN.md
+       - .github/workflows/clawhub-publish.yml
+   workflow_dispatch:
+ permissions:
+   contents: read
+   id-token: write
+ jobs:
+   publish:
+     uses: openclaw/clawhub/.github/workflows/skill-publish.yml@v0.23.1
+     with:
+       skill_path: .
+       dry_run: false
+       ref: ${{ github.sha }}
+     secrets:
+       clawhub_token: ${{ secrets.CLAWHUB_TOKEN }}

